(g) such sums as may be deemed appropriate to set aside in respect of depreciation or renewal of the property of the Authority, having regard to the amounts set aside out of the Fund under

(c) and fl;

(h) the cost, or any portion thereof, of any new works, plants, vessels, vehicles, machinery, equipment or appliances not being a renewal of the property of the Authority, which the Authority may determine to charge the Fund;

